flowchart TB
  plat["ACME Platform Chassis<br>starters, auto-configuration, APIs and SPIs,<br>one BOM, one release train"]
  teams["Application Teams<br>hundreds of services"]
  ext["Enterprise Extenders<br>custom providers"]
  pteam["Platform Team<br>capability owners, governance"]
  repo["Artifact Repository<br>BOM and starters"]
  ci["CI/CD<br>gates, smoke matrix, releases"]
  idp["Identity Provider - OIDC"]
  infra["Runtime Infrastructure<br>Kafka, RabbitMQ, PostgreSQL, Redis, S3, Vault"]
  obs["Observability Stack<br>OTLP, Prometheus, log pipeline"]

  teams -->|build on service-parent, add starters| plat
  ext -->|implement SPIs, certify via TCKs| plat
  pteam -->|design, review, release trains| plat
  plat -->|published through| repo
  repo -->|consumed by| teams
  ci -->|enforces constitution and quality gates| plat
  plat -->|security baseline delegates to| idp
  plat -->|providers connect to| infra
  plat -->|emits telemetry to| obs
